the subject of genociding minotaurs came up recently, but who would
want six minotaurs to fight? one is bad enough. I would never do
this even if the minotaur scan still worked. but anyway, i found
that a good way to get a powerful character is to obtain a cursed
scroll of genocide and genocide wraiths and nurses. if you genocide
wraiths make sure you're about level nine or ten with a negative AC
(As negative as possible) if you decide to genocide nurses make
sure to take off all your armor and weild -. A way to get more
cursed scrolls of genocide:if you have a cursed magic marker or
find a ghost pile with lots of scrolls. A cursed magic marker
will (i think, correct me if I'm wrong) always write cursed
scrolls. in a ghost pile the scrolls are usually cursed anyway
so that makes it easier. a chaotic alter helps, too. you can dip the
scrolls in unholy water to curse them.


